Package: miadi-music
Version: 0.1.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: miadi-music-render (>= 0.1.0), miadi-music-measure (>= 0.1.0), rsync, openssh-client, jq, curl, file
Recommends: miadi-music-video
Suggests: miadi
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: Music on a Miadi host: render, measure, and score to picture
 Installs the parts a Miadi host needs to make music, for an album or for
 the score of an interactive episode. Each part is its own package:
  miadi-music-render   ABC to MIDI, audio and the engraved page
  miadi-music-measure  NumPy, SciPy and Pillow in their own venv
  miadi-music-video    score videos for an episode (recommended)
 `miadi-music check` reports every tool each part needs and which package
 brings it. Install it alongside miadi: `apt install miadi miadi-music`.
